  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/533835/diamond-spheres-hustle-bustle?src=newest%3Faffiliate_id%3D3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Hustle &amp; Bustle</a></sup></p>\n<p>You can make Stealth checks in normal light at a -20 penalty, even when observed. This penalty is reduced to -10 while maintaining the light step approach.</p>\n<p>Additionally, a creature suffering from the dazzled condition is not treated as observing you for the purposes of Stealth.</p>\n<p>At 5 ranks in Stealth, you can also attempt Stealth checks in bright light with the above penalty.<br>\nAssociated Feat: Hellcat Stealth (Pathfinder Chronicles — Cheliax: Empire of Devils).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/infiltration#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
